{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" initial=\"a\">\n  <state id=\"a\"><transition event=\"go\" target=\"f\" target=\"a\"/></state><final id=\"f\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/xml001-duplicate-attribute.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xml001-duplicate-attribute.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":11,"byteOffset":146,"endColumn":61,"endLine":2,"startColumn":50,"startLine":2},"insertedContent":{"text":""}}]}],"description":{"text":"remove the repeated `target` attribute"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xml001-duplicate-attribute.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":61,"endLine":2,"startColumn":51,"startLine":2}}}],"message":{"markdown":"duplicate attribute `target`\n\n**Note:** each attribute may appear at most once in a start tag; a parser cannot choose between two values\n\n**Help:** keep one `target` attribute; a transition to several states lists their IDs in one value, separated by spaces (`target=\"a b\"`)\n\n**Spec:** XML 1.0 (Fifth Edition) §3.1 Start-Tags (WFC: Unique Att Spec)","text":"duplicate attribute `target`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":157,"start":147},"category":"syntax"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"`target` is first specified here"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xml001-duplicate-attribute.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":46,"endLine":2,"startColumn":40,"startLine":2}}}],"ruleId":"XML001"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"SCXML is an XML vocabulary; until the document parses, no schema or semantic rule can run"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: fix the XML syntax at the marked position: remove Markdown code fences or prose outside the single root element, keep `<?xml …?>` at the very start, escape `<` as `&lt;` and `&` as `&amp;` in attribute values and text (or use `<![CDATA[ … ]]>` in `<script>`), close or rename mismatched tags, quote attribute values, specify each attribute once, and never write `--` inside a comment.\n\nSpecification: XML 1.0 (Fifth Edition) §2.1 Well-Formed XML Documents\n\nRun `scx --explain XML001` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/xml/#sec-well-formed","id":"XML001","name":"XML001","properties":{"category":"syntax"},"shortDescription":{"text":"the document is not well-formed XML"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}